{
  "id": "1KI.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "1 Ŋirw. 14",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todwar Aija atemar itiyakin aronis nen a Yeroboam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, abu Abiya lokoku a Yeroboam todyakakin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi Yeroboam tema neni ka aberu keŋ, “Tonyou, kitusubun akoloŋinait, ikotere nyeyenut ŋituŋa atemar irae iyoŋ aberu a Yeroboam. Ape Silo; anerae eyai ekadwaran Aija nen. Aija iŋes akalimokinit ayoŋ atemar aruwor erwosit a ŋituŋa a lu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya ŋabopuloe ŋatomon, ŋaboboryo ŋuna erukitoe esibit ŋamugati ka ao ileleba locupa, tolot neni keŋ. Ikilimokini iŋes iyoŋ ŋuna itiyakin neni a edya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu aberu a Yeroboam kitiya ŋuna alimokinio iŋes, tolot iŋes Silo kai ka Aija. Pa apedorit Aija akitere ejok apaki ŋin, anerae aris ŋakonyen keŋ kemumu aŋuna ka amojoŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Ekapolon tema neni ka Aija, “Ebunit aberu a Yeroboam neni kon akiŋita ŋakiro alokoku keŋ, anerae edyaka lokoku keŋ. Emaikina iyoŋ tolimok iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna iyeni iyoŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoluni aberu ŋin nen, pa etusubuna iŋes aberu a Yeroboam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani iirari Aija eruye a ŋakejen keŋ apaki ŋina adolunio iŋes diyete epuke, tema Aija, “Tolomu tooma aberu a Yeroboam; kaanukiro itusubuna iyoŋ meere aberu a Yeroboam? Tolomu, anerae ekecikitae ayoŋ alimokin iyoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna apipilak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ape tolimok Yeroboam ebe, ‘Ebala Ekapolon Akuj ŋina a Ŋisirael: Abu ayoŋ eketopoloo iyoŋ alokidiŋ ŋituŋa, eketuruwo iyoŋ ekarikon a ŋituŋa kaŋ a Ŋisirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ido abu eela apukan aneni a ŋituŋa a Daudi aŋuna ka ainakin neni kon, nai nyikwaanikina iyoŋ ka Daudi eketiyan kaŋ, ŋolo abu kiwuap ŋuna abu ayoŋ ecik iŋes, abu iŋes ekewuap ayoŋ a etau keŋ a daadaŋ, itiyae ŋuna iyookino bon alokiŋaren kaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itiya iyoŋ ŋuna aronok, akilo ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu ke ekiŋaren. Itiyau iyoŋ aŋuna kon ŋakujo ŋace, ŋakujo ŋuna itiyaunitae a ŋasuwa; ikitoŋoo iyoŋ ayoŋ ka ikimana kaku kon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, ayauni ayoŋ ŋuna aronok neni a ŋituŋa a ekal a Yeroboam. Amunyari ayoŋ aneni a Yeroboam ŋikilyok daadaŋ, ŋipi ka ŋulu nyerae ŋipi alo Isirael. Ecunyari ayoŋ ŋituŋa a ekal a Yeroboam lopite ŋolo icunyia ituŋanan aoret todaun daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyamete ŋiŋokwo ŋituŋa a Yeroboam ŋulu etwanikinete lotaun, ido enyamete ŋikyeny ŋulu eporete ŋituŋa ŋulu etwanikinete nariet; anerae adau Ekapolon alimun ŋun.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, torotok a ne, toboŋo lore kon. Apaki ŋina idolio iyoŋ lotaun kus, iridakini edya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igworete Ŋisirael daadaŋ aŋuna keŋ ido tonuka iŋes, anerae iŋes bon alokal a Yeroboam iwuakinio nakipany aŋuna araakar iŋes bon alokal a Yeroboam italakarit Akuj ŋina a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elemuni Ekapolon nakoloŋit na ka esaa lopei lo erwosit ece kipuka Ŋisirael, emunyari erwosit ŋol ŋituŋa a ekal a Yeroboam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Isicani Ekapolon Ŋisirael emaranikinete lopite ŋolo iloilookinio ekuwuam eoot anakipi, elemari Ekapolon Ŋisirael anakwap keŋ a ŋina ajokan a ŋina abu iŋes inak atapapaa kec, ido ielari ikes yaye aŋolol ŋina enyaritae Eupurate, anerae apotu ikes kitoŋoa Ekapolon aŋuna etiyauniata ŋitorubei a akuj a ŋina anyaritae Asera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipotori Ekapolon Ŋisirael aŋuna a asecit a ŋina etiya Yeroboam, ido abu torikok Ŋisirael nasecit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonyou nai aberu a Yeroboam torotok a nen, bu tari Tirisa. Ani edoluni iŋes lopuke a akuj keŋ, kiridak edya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonuka Ŋisirael daadaŋ edya ŋol, kigworo aŋuna keŋ lopite ŋolo alimunitere anakirot ke Ekapolon, a ŋina abu Ekapolon kirwor aneni ka Aija a ekadwaran keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Yeroboam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Yeroboam ŋuluce daadaŋ, epite ŋolo kejio ka epite ŋolo kipukator, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeroboam kipuka Isirael ŋikaru ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiarei ido, abu totwana. Abu lokoku keŋ Nadab kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ, kipuka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Reoboam Yudaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin arae Reoboam lokoku a Solomon epukat Yudaya. Arae ŋikaru a Reoboam ŋatomoniomwon ka epei apaki ŋina esyakinia akipuka Yudaya, ido abu iŋes kipuka Yudaya alo Yerusalem ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋikanikaarei. Kipuka iŋes Yudaya alotaun a ŋolo abu Ekapolon toseu toyakaun ekiro keŋ alotaunio a daadaŋ a ŋulu a ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael. Arae ekiro a toto a Reoboam Naama, arae iŋes Amonait. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya daŋ kitiyata ŋuna aronok alokiŋaren Ekapolon, apotu ikes kitiyata ŋuna aronon nooi akilo ŋuna etiyato atapapaa kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya daŋ toduko aŋuna kec ŋakiboisyo ŋunamukur, kiwuanakis erae ŋakujo kec ŋamoru ka ŋitorubei ka akuj a ŋina enyaritae Asera lomukur ŋulu aoyak daadaŋ ka lokito ŋulu alibak daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋuna aronok nabo nooi, ayakasi ŋimalaae ka ŋamalaae nakiboisyo ŋun, ŋuna elipyata ŋituŋa alo Yudaya. Abu Reoboam kisyak akitiya ŋakiro ŋuna aronok ŋuna etiyaete ŋituŋa ŋulu abu Akuj kirita anakwapin kec a ŋuna abu iŋes inak Ŋisirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋikan ipukat erwosit Reoboam Yudaya abu Sisak erwosit a Ijipit torem Yerusalem; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwok ebari ŋolo ayai Kai ke Ekapolon ka ebari ŋolo ayai kai ke erwosit, ya ibore daadaŋ alo Yerusalem, ya tari ŋaupala daadaŋ ŋuna etiyat Solomon a egolid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu erwosit Reoboam kitiyau ŋaupala ŋace, a eburonis kilunyok neni a ŋuna aponi tolemarae; inak iŋes ŋun neni a ŋulu apolokinito ŋulu eteete ŋipukei a akai ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki daadaŋ ŋina alosyo erwosit Kai ke Ekapolon, atiŋeneneete ŋiketeok keŋ ŋaupala, torukosi ka iŋes, ani ekaku kinyakasi ŋaupala nagule ŋina eyokiyere akai a erwosit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo nai a Reoboam daadaŋ ka ŋuna daadaŋ etiyat iŋes, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Yudaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Reoboam ka Yeroboam torubakis ejiete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Reoboam totwan, ido aponi tonukae lotaun a Daudi neni anukitae atapapaa keŋ. Arae ekiro a toto keŋ Naama ŋina arae Amonait. Abu lokoku keŋ Abiyam kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Yudaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
